        <Dialogs>
          <Dialog>○○○○○○○○</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(I've only just called, but
they accepted my application
right away.)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(I don't want to be late on my
first day at work. It's hot,
but I must hurry...)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Family Restaurant "Dixie's".
I'll be working here from
today on, huh...？)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Um, I guess this is the
employees' entrance...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>？？？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>All right, then.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Phew... it's hot. Taking out
the trash on a day like
this, ugh...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Um...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Ah... Could you be... The new
employee？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(What a beautiful person...
She looks mature. No！ This is
not the time for this！)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yes. My name is
▲苗字▲ ▲名前▲.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Anegasaki</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I'm Nene Anegasaki.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hehe, you caught me
complaining.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Oh, and I've been asked to
train you, so nice to meet
you？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Okay, Anegasaki-san.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>This is my first job and I've
just moved in. I will have to
learn a lot from you. So
please take care of me.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Oh, I see.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...Hmm～, a little stiff,
maybe？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Is that so？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>You should be formal to the
customers. But you can talk
normally to me, okay？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>But you're my senior...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>That's kind of... You know,
I look grown-up, right？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>When someone near my age talks
to me too formally, it just
makes me feel... You
understand, right？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>How old are you then,
Anegasaki-san？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>A third-year at your high
school. The manager told me
a junior from my school was
coming.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Eh？ You're a high school
student!?</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...Right. Yes, I know.
Everyone's always surprised.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>No, it's not... I mean you're
so pretty. That's why I
thought you were much older...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Now you're flattering me？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Of course not. So, um...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Then, no more polite speech
from now on. Do that, and
I'll forgive you.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I'll tr... I will.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hehe. Let's work hard
together. Now, let's get
inside. I'll explain to you
what we do here.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Looks like this part-time job
will be fun...)</Dialog>
        </Dialogs>
